    "Id": "chassisdef_rikki_tikki_tavi_RTT-2",
    "Name": "Rikki Tikki Tavi",
    "Details": "The Rikki Tikki Tavi 2 combines two ER PPC, an Ultra AC/10, two ER Large Lasers and two Medium Pulse Lasers into quite a dangerous combination of weapons. The only flaw the design has could be the heat generation, but most Clan MechWarriors are used to running hot.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Distracting</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.24</color></b>",
