  "StockRole": "Juggernaut",
  "YangsThoughts": "A pirate band found one of these drifting in a misjumped dropship, not a soul left alive aboard, just skeletal remains and a strange 'Mech in the cargo bay. Nothing about it matched Star League records they knew. Named it after that old Terran tale on account of the mongoose painted on the shoulder. Sold it to King Grimm for fifty million C-Bills, though it never made it to Oberon. Mysterious white fighters tore the whole convoy apart before they got there.",
